# beard/full: Full beard: the cheeks, the jaw and a pointed chin in the hair ramp, the mouth showing
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to HAIR in wave 2). On the head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role beard full
layer beard
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -2 -11
|ab........ba
|abcdcc.ccbba
|abcdcccccbba
|.abdcccbbba.
|..abccbba...
|...aaaa.....

view U key rest origin -2 -11
|a..........a
|a..........a

view R key rest origin -5 -10
|...abb...
|abdccc...
|abcdccca.
|.abdccbba
|..abbba..
|...aa....

view L key rest origin -2 -10
|...abb...
|...abdccc
|.abcdccca
|abdccbba.
|..abbba..
|....aa...

# (P2c ladder slice, LADDER-HEAD, iterations 2-3) under a helm facing R / L: the ear and the cheek stay bare (the eye,
# the nose and the mouth pixel all read), a short moustache over the mouth, and a trimmed beard along the jaw to a chin
# below the mouth in hair steps 2-4 (step 1 only on its underside), lit at its top-left, so it reads as hair, never as a
# mask (iteration 3: the sideburn under the ear dropped, the mass a step lighter)
view R key rest origin -5 -10 when capped replace
|..........
|.......cdb
|..........
|..bcd..dcb
|...bdeddb.
|....bccb..
|.....aa...

view L key rest origin -1 -10 when capped replace
|..........
|bdc.......
|..........
|bcd..dcb..
|.bddedb...
|..bccb....
|...aa.....
